        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Pomeranian Fantasy</strong> is an idle fantasy RPG where adventures quietly unfold on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080500/extras/31d84c89ebeb2431d290569f75a07fee.avif?t=1765466903\" width=1560 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working, studying, or playing other games, your character automatically explores dungeons, battles monsters, and collects equipment. Open the window during a quick break, and you might find level-ups or newly discovered legendary equipment waiting for you. No manual control needed—just keep it open and enjoy a full RPG experience that progresses automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080500/extras/f3961d083a263038bc3c432983190c2c.avif?t=1765466903\" width=1148 height=660 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Should Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who love multitasking</strong> - Progresses while you work, watch videos, or play other games, perfect for busy people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who love watching numbers grow</strong> - Feel the satisfaction of growth through levels, stats, and equipment enhancement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectors</strong> - Perfect for those who want to complete a catalog of 100+ equipment items and unlock all achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro game enthusiasts</strong> - Pixel art graphics and classic RPG elements create a nostalgic atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who want to liven up their desktop</strong> - Watch battles in a small window while working for a nice change of pace</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Might Not Be For You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action game lovers</strong> - Fully automatic, so there's zero joy from manual control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who want instant results</strong> - This is a slow-burn experience with no instant gratification</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-focused players</strong> - Progresses methodically with no deep narrative to expect</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Pomeranian Fantasy</strong> is an idle fantasy RPG where adventures quietly unfold on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080500/extras/31d84c89ebeb2431d290569f75a07fee.avif?t=1765466903\" width=1560 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working, studying, or playing other games, your character automatically explores dungeons, battles monsters, and collects equipment. Open the window during a quick break, and you might find level-ups or newly discovered legendary equipment waiting for you. No manual control needed—just keep it open and enjoy a full RPG experience that progresses automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080500/extras/f3961d083a263038bc3c432983190c2c.avif?t=1765466903\" width=1148 height=660 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Should Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who love multitasking</strong> - Progresses while you work, watch videos, or play other games, perfect for busy people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who love watching numbers grow</strong> - Feel the satisfaction of growth through levels, stats, and equipment enhancement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectors</strong> - Perfect for those who want to complete a catalog of 100+ equipment items and unlock all achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro game enthusiasts</strong> - Pixel art graphics and classic RPG elements create a nostalgic atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who want to liven up their desktop</strong> - Watch battles in a small window while working for a nice change of pace</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Might Not Be For You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action game lovers</strong> - Fully automatic, so there's zero joy from manual control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People who want instant results</strong> - This is a slow-burn experience with no instant gratification</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-focused players</strong> - Progresses methodically with no deep narrative to expect</p>",
